arena provides CMake targets:

    find_package(Arena CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Arena::Protocol Arena::Abi)

  Available with the "model" feature:

    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Arena::Model)

  Available with the "ecal" feature:

    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Arena::TransportEcal)

arena also ships the canonical .NET, Python, and Rust SDK sources under
share/arena/sdk; see share/arena/sdk-layout.json for the layout.
